{ t => 'Reciprocity line', p => 'You asked the room "good weekend?" — write your own two-sentence answer plus the line that turns it back to the group.', a => q{Model: "I assembled a bookshelf with instructions that were clearly translated twice. It has one shelf upside down and I have decided it is a feature. Marco — you look like someone who owns a drill; tell me it gets easier." Answer, spin, bounce.} },
],
