['Elena (Tech Lead)', q{<strong>Correct instinct.</strong> The rule I give every new joiner: <em>match the depth of the person who opened the topic.</em> Daniel jokes about football, you joke back. <strong>If someone opens with something real — a sick parent, a hard week — you do not have to match the story, but you match the respect.</strong>}, q{<strong>直觉正确。</strong>我给每个新人的规则：<em>匹配话题开启者的深度。</em>Daniel 开玩笑，你就回玩笑。<strong>如果有人开了个真实的头——生病的父母、艰难的一周——你不必交换同样的故事，但要匹配同样的尊重。</strong>}],
