q{<strong>Match depth AND respect.</strong> When someone opens real, you owe respect even if you do not owe a matching story.},
q{<strong>The volume tell works everywhere.</strong> Quieter and closer means the band changed — exit via the kettle without ceremony.},
q{<strong>Collect veteran imperatives.</strong> "Match the depth", "refills are always available" — write them down; unwritten rules only survive if someone writes them.},
],
