['Vivian (Hong Kong)', q{<strong>The Thursday load doubles during UK reporting season</strong> — <em>if your dashboards can wait until Friday morning for non-critical refreshes, everyone sleeps.</em> <strong>Nobody documents the calendar of pain.</strong>}, q{<strong>英国的报送季会让周四负载翻倍</strong>——<em>如果你们的仪表盘能接受非关键刷新挪到周五早上，大家都能睡个好觉。</em><strong>没人把"痛苦日历"写下来。</strong>}],
['You (New Joiner)', q{<strong>That one tip reorganises my refresh schedule.</strong> <em>Your question — ask me anything.</em> And the favour: <em>I will draft the calendar-of-pain section for the shared wiki this week — your knowledge, written down, your name on it.</em>}, q{<strong>这一条建议就重排了我的刷新计划。</strong><em>轮到你了——随便问。</em>还有人情：<em>这周我为共享 wiki 起草"痛苦日历"一节——你的知识、写下来、署你的名。</em>}],
