['Elena (Tech Lead)', q{<strong>That message will clear approval in an hour</strong> — <em>it answers the three questions finance always asks</em> (what, whose budget, when) before they are asked. <strong>Now the table craft:</strong> <em>how do you seat twelve so nobody orbits?</em>}, q{<strong>这条消息一小时内就能过审批</strong>——<em>它提前回答了财务必问的三个问题</em>（什么事、谁的预算、什么时候）。<strong>现在到餐桌手艺：</strong><em>12 个人怎么坐才没人被边缘化？</em>}],
