['Elena (Tech Lead)', q{<strong>Both, but the hook matters more.</strong> <em>A decline with no counter-offer reads as opting out of the team;</em> a decline with a Monday hook reads as <strong>opting out of the evening only.</strong> <em>The gossip is the relationship — I just reschedule it.</em>}, q{<strong>两者都要，但钩子更重要。</strong><em>没有反向提议的拒绝读起来像脱离团队；</em>带周一钩子的拒绝读起来只是<strong>退出今晚。</strong><em>八卦才是关系本身——我只是改了时间。</em>}],
